  - MUTATE F_PermissionMatrix  → runs/C-L1/mutated_F_PermissionMatrix.als
    rationale: Removing the permission matrix definition allows Alloy to introduce unauthorized (role, operation) pairs, which the LeastPrivilege and PermissionCompleteness assertions should catch.
    expected to FAIL: LeastPrivilege, PermissionCompleteness
      - LeastPrivilege: PASS (vacuous?)
      - PermissionCompleteness: PASS (vacuous?)

  - MUTATE F_AuditCompleteness  → runs/C-L1/mutated_F_AuditCompleteness.als
    rationale: Removing the constraint that every access request produces exactly one audit entry allows Alloy to create access requests without corresponding audit entries, which violates the audit-completeness invariant.
    expected to FAIL: AuditCompleteness, FR_008_AlwaysAudit
      - AuditCompleteness: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_008_AlwaysAudit: PASS (vacuous?)

  - MUTATE F_AppendOnly  → runs/C-L1/mutated_F_AppendOnly.als
    rationale: Removing the constraint that audit entry IDs are unique allows Alloy to create two audit entries with the same id, which violates the immutability invariant.
    expected to FAIL: AppendOnly, FR_010_AuditImmutable
      - AppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_010_AuditImmutable: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_OwnershipBasedAccess  → runs/C-L1/mutated_F_OwnershipBasedAccess.als
    rationale: Removing the care-team-membership gating constraint allows Alloy to grant permitted access to a clinician who is not on the patient's care team, violating the ownership-based access control invariant.
    expected to FAIL: OwnershipBasedAccess, FR_006_CareTeamGating
      - OwnershipBasedAccess: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_006_CareTeamGating: PASS (vacuous?)

  - MUTATE F_NoInformationLeakage  → runs/C-L1/mutated_F_NoInformationLeakage.als
    rationale: Removing the constraint that denied and not-found outcomes are byte-identical allows Alloy to distinguish between these outcomes, leaking information about patient existence.
    expected to FAIL: NoInformationLeakage, FR_007_ByteEquivalent
      - NoInformationLeakage: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_007_ByteEquivalent: PASS (vacuous?)

